  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">`appsettings.template.json` AiSearch index names + all 8 `AllowedIndexes` entries are `#{...}#`-tokenized; no hardcoded index name remains in shipped template values.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The `KnowledgeIndexName`/`SharedIndexName` split is consolidated to one read/write setting (G-9 closed); a test proves read and write resolve to the same index.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">All communication indexing routes through `SearchIndexNameResolver`; no direct config-key index reads remain.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`dotnet build` + `dotnet test` green; publish-size delta + CVE reported; ceiling ≤60 MB respected.</criterion>
